            "heading": "Technical specifications and treatment details",
            "text": "",
            "code": "<div id=\"collapseOnezzz\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionExample\">\n                                <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n\n                                    <!-- Tabs -->\n                                    <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs mb-4\" id=\"productTabs-1\" role=\"tablist\">\n                                        <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n                                            <button class=\"nav-link active\" id=\"mask-tab-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#mask-1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"mask-1\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                                Q-Rejuvalight Pro LED Mask\n                                            </button>\n                                        </li>\n                                        <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n                                            <button class=\"nav-link\" id=\"neck-tab-1\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#neck-1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"neck-1\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n                                                Neck &amp; Décolletage LED\n                                            </button>\n                                        </li>\n                                    </ul>\n\n                                    <!-- Tab Content -->\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"productTabsContent-1\">\n                                        <!-- Mask Tab -->\n                                        <div class=\"tab-pane fade active show\" id=\"mask-1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mask-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n                                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                                <div class=\"col-4 col-md-3\">\n                                                    <p class=\"\"><strong>Treatment details </strong></p>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <div class=\"col-8 col-md-9\">\n                                                    <div class=\"treat_tech_details\">\n                                                        <p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0441/1431/3365/files/rejuv_icon1.svg?v=1746593643\" alt=\"\">\n                                                            <span> <strong>TREATMENT\n                                                                    TIME:</strong> 3 minutes </span>\n                                                        </p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0441/1431/3365/files/rejuv_icon2.svg?v=1746593661\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>TREATMENT\n                                                                    MODES:</strong> Anti-Aging, Anti-Breakout,\n                                                                customized\n                                                                treatment </span></p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0441/1431/3365/files/rejuv_icon3.svg?v=1746593671\" alt=\"\"><span>\n                                                                <strong>USE:</strong>\n                                                                Use daily after cleansing, before topical skincare\n                                                            </span></p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0441/1431/3365/files/rejuv_icon4.svg?v=1746593681\" alt=\"\"><span>\n                                                                <strong>OPERATION:</strong> Wireless, hands-free, app\n                                                                (Android and iOS) </span></p>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"dark_line\"></div>\n                                            <div class=\"row\">\n\n                                                <div class=\"col-4 col-md-3\">\n                                                    <p class=\"\"><strong> Tech specs </strong></p>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <div class=\"col-8 col-md-9\">\n                                                    <div class=\"treat_tech_details\">\n                                                        <p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0441/1431/3365/files/rejuv_icon5.svg?v=1746593692\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>WAVELENGTHS:</strong> 415nm, 605nm,\n                                                                630nm,\n                                                                660nm, 880nm </span></p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0441/1431/3365/files/rejuv_icon6.svg?v=1746593707\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>LEDs:</strong>\n                                                                160 dual core </span></p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0441/1431/3365/files/rejuv_icon7.svg?v=1746593720\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>CERTIFICATIONS:</strong> FDA, TGA,\n                                                                CE, UKCA\n                                                            </span> </p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0441/1431/3365/files/rejuv_icon8.svg?v=1746593727\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>CHARGING\n                                                                    TIME:</strong> 2 hours </span></p>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n\n                                        <!-- Neck Tab -->\n                                        <div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"neck-1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"neck-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n                                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                                <div class=\"col-4 col-md-3\">\n                                                    <p class=\"\"><strong>Treatment details </strong></p>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <div class=\"col-8 col-md-9\">\n                                                    <div class=\"treat_tech_details\">\n                                                        <p><img src=\"assets/rejuv_icon1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>TREATMENT\n                                                                    TIME:</strong> 10 minutes </span></p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"assets/rejuv_icon3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>USE:</strong>\n                                                                5–7 times per week </span></p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"assets/rejuv_icon4.svg\" alt=\"\"> <span>\n                                                                <strong>OPERATION:</strong> Wireless, hands-free with\n                                                                controller </span></p>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"dark_line\"></div>\n                                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                                <div class=\"col-4 col-md-3\">\n                                                    <p class=\"\"><strong> Tech specs </strong></p>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <div class=\"col-8 col-md-9\">\n                                                    <div class=\"treat_tech_details\">\n                                                        <p><img src=\"assets/rejuv_icon5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>WAVELENGTHS:</strong> 633nm (Red),\n                                                                830nm\n                                                                (Near-Infrared) </span></p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"assets/rejuv_icon6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>LEDs:</strong>\n                                                                55 dual core </span></p>\n                                                        <p><img src=\"assets/rejuv_icon8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span><strong>CHARGING\n                                                                    TIME:</strong> 4 hours </span></p>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>"
